# Nothing private, nothing large, nothing that would be rebuilt anyway.
#
# `data/` matters most: it is 230 MB of market candles plus your journal and uploads. Copying it
# into the image would bloat every layer and put your trades inside an artefact that gets pushed to
# a registry.
node_modules
.next
data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
*.command
*.log
*.bak
Notion Backtests.json*
notion-images.json
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.claude
tests
